# Ethical Dimensions

Every AI impact can affect one or more ethical dimensions.

## Fairness

Does AI treat people equitably?

## Transparency

Can people understand how AI reaches its decisions?

## Accountability

Who is responsible for the outcomes produced by AI?

## Privacy

How does AI collect, process, and protect personal data?

## Safety & Security

Does AI reduce or increase risks to people and systems?

## Human Autonomy

Does AI empower people or reduce their ability to make independent decisions?
